   "text": "第二十四条　网络产品、服务应当符合相关国家标准的强制性要求。"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:24/s2",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "provider",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "网络产品、服务的提供者不得设置恶意程序；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:24/s3",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "OBSERVED",
   "rule": "zh:public-trace",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "发现其网络产品、服务存在安全缺陷、漏洞等风险时，应当立即采取补救措施，按照规定及时告知用户并向有关主管部门报告。"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:24/s4",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "provider",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "网络产品、服务的提供者应当为其产品、服务持续提供安全维护；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:24/s5",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "在规定或者当事人约定的期限内，不得终止提供安全维护。"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:24/s6",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "provider",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "OBSERVED",
   "rule": "zh:public-trace",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "网络产品、服务具有收集用户信息功能的，其提供者应当向用户明示并取得同意；"
  },
